00:28:55,181 --> 00:28:59,080
safety scissors.

540
00:28:59,180 --> 00:29:02,280
So to ensure those sharp edges make the grade,

541
00:29:02,380 --> 00:29:06,120
SSI's engineers produce them using a meticulous hardening

