00:29:10,900 --> 00:29:13,600
or a beveled 45-degree angle along the whole edge.

545
00:29:13,700 --> 00:29:16,460
And what we're going to do is fill that area in with weld.

546
00:29:16,560 --> 00:29:20,900
And after it cools and settles, it becomes incredibly hard.

547
00:29:21,000 --> 00:29:23,700
Next, workers grind down the irregular welded

548
00:29:23,701 --> 00:29:24,940
of each blade.

