00:30:21,361 --> 00:30:26,400
and an underlying screen, leftover shreds fall out

567
00:30:26,500 --> 00:30:27,960
as little more than particles.

568
00:30:34,300 --> 00:30:37,940
Not every tool vying for the title of World Sharpest

569
00:30:38,040 --> 00:30:40,620
has a solid edge.

570
00:30:40,720 --> 00:30:44,680
Imagine a razor sharp wonder that captures lightning

