635
00:34:11,840 --> 00:34:14,740
As sharp and precise as lasers are, however,

636
00:34:14,840 --> 00:34:17,440
they're not brawny enough to cut efficiently through steel

637
00:34:17,540 --> 00:34:20,500
more than an inch thick, like some of that

