00:34:26,040 --> 00:34:28,380
To tackle that type of job, you need

640
00:34:28,480 --> 00:34:32,880
this otherworldly cutting power, plasma.

641
00:34:32,881 --> 00:34:38,120
Plasma is gas, superheated to the fourth state of matter.

642
00:34:38,220 --> 00:34:44,120
It's found burning on the sun or flashing in lightning.

643
00:34:44,220 --> 00:34:47,420
This right now is cutting half inch plate.

644
00:34:47,520 --> 00:34:50,440
It's cutting about 75 inches a minute.

645
00:34:50,540 --> 00:34:52,800
And it can do up to about 2 and 1 1

646
00:34:52,900 --> 00:34:55,940
half inch thick plate.

647
00:34:56,040 --> 00:34:59,080
The ultra thin ray of plasma is capable of a blasting

648
00:34:59,081 --> 00:35:01,580
just four times thicker than a human hair.

649
00:35:04,920 --> 00:35:08,220
The power of the incision comes from plasma cutters hovering

650
00:35:08,320 --> 00:35:09,720
