668
00:36:13,280 --> 00:36:17,160
So until it starts cutting, it basically shoots the sparks

669
00:36:17,260 --> 00:36:19,300
back out of the top.

670
00:36:19,400 --> 00:36:22,100
But once the plasma fully penetrates,

671
00:36:22,200 --> 00:36:25,140
the computer-controlled cutters have no trouble crafting

672
00:36:25,141 --> 00:36:28,140
crafting any shapes fancied by its operators.

673
00:36:33,880 --> 00:36:36,180
Just how sharp a cut will our technology

