00:38:46,860 --> 00:38:48,580
This puncturing ability is different

717
00:38:48,680 --> 00:38:50,580
than a conventional syringe needle,

718
00:38:50,680 --> 00:38:52,820
which terminates at an angled point,

719
00:38:52,920 --> 00:38:55,860
like a sharp-ended straw.

