00:39:53,220 --> 00:39:55,560
The external layer has the hard enamel.

737
00:39:55,660 --> 00:40:01,500
And here is the inside that is the softer dentine.

738
00:40:01,600 --> 00:40:04,800
As a rat chews in bites, the dentine wears away

739
00:40:04,900 --> 00:40:06,400
